Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fixup! test(v2): migrate functional fixtures and
 harnesses to native transactions

Detect a missing generated Chronik Python module before starting selected Chronik tests. Name the existing protobuf-chronik target and check-functional workflow; do not change CMake dependencies or global Python paths. The historical direct-runner invocation bypassed the already correct build prerequisite. Unit controls cover missing, generated, disabled and unselected cases.
---
